{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Black Chapter&quot; is a multi-route narrative visual novel that tells a suspenseful story set in a world inhabited by furry. Players will take on the role of Andy, a young police officer newly assigned to the M.C.S. During a murder investigation, he encounters three individuals who will completely change the course of his life. As Andy forms deeper bonds with them, he begins to uncover the sinister secrets hidden beneath society\u2019s surface...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter. Help Andy survive his turbulent fate\u2014and reach the ones he holds dear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official release will include three complete chapters and three fully independent story routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first two chapters follow a common storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third chapter branches based on player choices, leading to different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1 hour per chapter, totaling 5\u20136 hours for a full playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We warmly invite you to add the game to your wishlist to receive the latest updates and release information!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3272880?t=1755875688","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272880/563a5ea9da73a3b3fb7c65ea3d318c4324acc3f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755875688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272880/ded9c3c1c1e6a33fbac35ffcaedca58b6f7c3c36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755875688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272880/ded9c3c1c1e6a33fbac35ffcaedca58b6f7c3c36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755875688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family 